            "shortq": "$$\\mu=:mu$$, $$P(X\\le ${:mu-:a})=:Q$$: $$${['P(X\\ge ' + (:mu+:a) + ')', 'P(' + (:mu-:a) + '\\le X\\le ' + (:mu+:a) + ')', 'P(X\\le ' + (:mu+:a) + ')'][:typ]}$$",
            "answer": "Die Glockenkurve ist symmetrisch zu $$x=:mu$$: $$P(X\\ge ${:mu+:a})=P(X\\le ${:mu-:a})=:Q$$.<br>$$P=${['', '1-2\\cdot ' + :Q + '=', '1-' + :Q + '='][:typ]}\\color{red}{:R}$$",
