            "shortq": "$$\\varphi(x)=\\dfrac{1}{${:s===1 ? '' : :s}\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\,e^{-\\frac{${:mu===0 ? 'x^2' : '(x' + MMmath.signedNumber(-:mu) + ')^2'}}{:zz}}$$: $$${:typ===0 ? '\\mu' : '\\sigma'}=?$$",
            "answer": "Vergleich mit $$\\dfrac{1}{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\,e^{-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}}$$: $$\\mu=:mu$$, $$2\\sigma^2=:zz$$, also $$${:typ===0 ? '\\mu' : '\\sigma'}=\\color{red}{${:typ===0 ? :mu : :s}}$$",
